// Public synthetic reference for the canonical addressable dialogue avatar.

@chapter dialogue_avatar_demo "Addressable dialogue avatar"

@scene dialogue_avatar_start
@dialogue_avatar set asset=background:bg_black.png visible=false position=120,80 origin=0,0 scale=0.45,0.45
「The stable avatar exists while remaining independently hidden.」
@dialogue_avatar show transition=fade duration=0.3
「Show and hide use the fixed dialogue:avatar channel.」

@combine
@dialogue_avatar set asset=background:bg_cafe.png transition=fade duration=0.3
「A typed avatar cue is dispatched once at this voice segment boundary.」
@dialogue_avatar hide transition=fade duration=0.2
「The next cue retains its own authored source line and duration.」
@end

@presentation_batch policy=join
  @stage reference show asset=background:bg_black.png fit=contain transition=cut duration=0
  @dialogue_avatar show transition=fade duration=0.2
  @dialogue_visibility hide transition=fade duration=0.2
@end
@dialogue_visibility show
@dialogue_avatar remove
「Stage, dialogue surface, and avatar remain independently addressable.」
